, {"file_name": "ZeroCaliber2_Screenshot05.png", "id": "239766985659915", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75334066_239766988993248_484809953301683563_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tBN_9sVgCO4Q7kNvwFn5Kxg&_nc_oc=AdpNfVeLt7bWwgC9spqvJZIhqdcwUVmnCKGdEK45L5k0euVx8ua7-GmHqlVdqpJUkSI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLhxD5FhMqoIFWOOM1hN7OFTyl-UUAnJNFm3B3QlE8q7w&oe=6AB67FFA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ZeroCaliber2_CoverArt_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "219203984540676", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984447_219203987874009_6483626324491434520_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2_368taur8AQ7kNvwEt0F_6&_nc_oc=AdoQI5JEmP2lSQwDB4tinFVyQMV2EIWVNzvCAKvg2lRcRe87iXAuiVsR5C7ROG7j-2o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLFipmR3mazHRYJick7nYlT8y8JHH6Y0YTfym3O19qbOQ&oe=6AB696DA"}, "display_name": "Zero Caliber 2", "keywords": ["coop", "shooter", "story", "military", "campaign"], "long_description": "We can't save the world alone, the OSA needs you soldier - enlist NOW by wishlisting Zero Caliber 2 in the Meta Quest store! \n\n### THE SEQUEL ###\n\nYour favorite all-in-one VR FPS made infinitely better! Get ready to experience the thrill of your virtual life in Zero Caliber 2, the sequel to our critically acclaimed Zero Caliber: Reloaded military shooter! \n\nCinematic action, explosions, tons of weapons to unlock, a full-blown single player/Co-op campaign (taking place after the events of the prequel), PvP, native mod support, zombies, airstrikes, more explosions and a VR experience you'll never forget! \n\nComing to your Meta Quest in 2024.\n\n### COMMUNITY ###\n\nTo participate in future playtests, catch sneak peeks and behind the scenes, join our awesome community on Discord: \n-> discord.gg/xrealgames <- \n\nAnd follow us on: \n- Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/XREALGamesVR\n- X: ht